      "message": "I was thinking about this on the train home, and we should probably still return `false` in the case where we\u0027re writing the _exact same_ PTE, otherwise concurrent translation faults could get stuck in a livelock as they repeatedly fault/unmap/map the same page forever.\n\nThe host fault handler special-cases the `-EAGAIN` return value in this case iirc and just returns back to EL1.",
